{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_04",
  "title": "掌柜",
  "storyCode": "WR-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c1f8cba5cdd08a6769766a320d87dddc7f8d6b7bf37ed6577e4ded0f01940ad6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "还有人没离开这儿吗！赶紧去先生那儿躲着！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "往东边走，快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......自从留意到天色之后就意识到，这里真的是越往西边走越靠近黑夜呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "这么说的话，我们现在是“从正午走向黄昏”？还挺有诗意诶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......还是不对，这“白天到黑夜”的距离也太短了，我们才走了几步路？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "画卷长短时有变化，各处景象光怪陆离，画中人为自己的天地寻了一份规矩，但说到底，也是假的。这也是在所难免的事情嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "所以我说——等等，什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "呃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你刚才说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔啊啊啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "——！还有人没离开这儿吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "在这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "救、救命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "莫怕，小僧来也！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "唔，果不其然，被斩之后便化作墨渍，怪哉怪哉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "大师，好身手哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "莫要掉以轻心，姑娘，你赶紧往东边去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "text": "好，好！你们也要小心啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......似乎还有不少来不及逃走的村民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "可能是太过突然，反应不及——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "爸爸？妈妈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "那、那边有个孩子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "不好——快趴下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "来不及了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "呜呜......呜啊啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "唔哦，千钧一发！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "没受伤吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "呜呜呜......没......呜呜呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "刚才......刚才是不是有什么东西刺穿了那玩意的喉咙......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "是克洛丝，真是刁钻的角度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "她，她在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "别找了，找不到的，只要知道她在就足够了，得优先保证所有村民都离开这片黑夜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "嚯，当真好默契，真让小僧大开眼界。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "呜呜......呜呜呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "但、但我们要带着这个小姑娘一起走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......你先带她离开这里，送去安全的地方，没问题吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "没问题！哪儿能呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "但是——我实在不忍抛下恩人，独自避难呀！不能陪着恩人抛头颅洒热血，多可惜——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你可以先把孩子送去煮伞先生那里，然后再回来找我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "啊哈哈......欸......好的，我会的，会的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "小妹妹，跟哥哥走好不好呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "呜......呜呜......叔叔，你看见我妈妈了吗......呜呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "哥哥带你去找妈妈好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "text": "呜......嗯......谢谢叔叔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......咳。恩人呐，那我，先走一步？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "先生，只靠嵯峨和那三位英雄，打不打紧啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "text": "......无妨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民甲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "咋回事儿啊？先生今儿是不是心情不好？昨天忘了睡觉啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民乙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "text": "先生温文尔雅，不像是个喜怒无常的人呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民甲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "text": "一定是先生为我们劳神操心，累了吧，我们应当多为他着想点，让他睡着吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "六根清净！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "斩却烦恼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "油炸豆腐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎，嘎啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......你还挺厉害的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "小僧自幼在寺庙长大，耳濡目染，稍微学了些刀法罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你这叫稍微？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "莫要在意，待小僧为炎熔施主开出一条道来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎......嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "那些怪物已经开始怕你了......说起来，墨魉是有智慧的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎！嘎啊！嘎啊嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "唔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "怎么停手了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎，嘎嘎啊，嘎啊嘎啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "嗯，嗯嗯，嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "喂！？你还能听懂这玩意说话的！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "略通一二。施主你看，这一只墨魉也没犯什么过错，若是真心悔过，不再侵扰镇上邻里，放了就放了罢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......这样好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "没关系，小僧自有分寸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "这附近安静些了......应该没有其他村民留在这里，现在我们可以谈谈了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "炎熔施主好生严肃，莫非小僧做错了什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "这倒没有，只是你刚才说了......画卷？你似乎对这里很了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "那可不，小僧在此地云游，也有段时间了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "这地方看上去可不值得“云游”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "一幅画卷，能有多大？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "什么意思......我们在画里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "正是如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......到底什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "啊，小僧明白了，几位施主和小僧一样，也是误入此中山河——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "呃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "想当初，小僧只是途经大炎勾吴地界，突发奇想，想去拜访一下那位大家后人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "见灰齐山飞瀑之下美不胜收，就在一处山中茅屋露宿一宿，没想到眼睛一闭一睁，就到这里来啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "等、等等，什么意思，你也是来找“夕”的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "夕？小僧倒未曾听说过这个名讳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "小僧寻的，是那位“一笔拙山起，何处话风流”的炎国画家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "不过算算时日，怕那画家已经不在人世了，故而想去探访其故居，如此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "反正你也是先去的大炎勾吴灰齐山，然后莫名其妙就到了这里的，对吧！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "唔，确是如此不假，但施主为何如此激动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "然后你说这里是画卷——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "天地人皆不合情理，炎熔施主，就没意识到吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "这我也知道，可为什么是画......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "小僧也难说明白，不过这婆山镇，已经是小僧游历的......大概百余幅画卷啦！至少自己身在何处，还是心知肚明的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "可......那些人，是活生生的人，茶水有滋味，水果也能吃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "只是某种法术的结果吗？可如果这是法术的结果......这是什么样的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "这小僧可就毫无头绪了。要不是曾有幸一瞥这天地真实，小僧怕也意识不到自己身在何处吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "此处没有天灾所扰，各界生灵，都遵循着自己的规矩，自成方圆，妙不可言。小僧留在这里，未尝没有图个安心的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "哈哈，看施主一脸困惑，也在所难免，小僧初见夕娥的时候，也是施主这般模样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "慢着......你说见谁！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "小僧见了——等等，那处灯火，莫非是掌柜的当铺？她竟然没去避难，这可不成！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "等等我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "......好了好了，别这么激动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "为什么要来吓唬人？她是怎么说的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "啊......是这样......她还是老样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "掌柜的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "......去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "掌柜的，你没事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "我没事的......这位就是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "哦，这位施主就是炎熔，是之前传得沸沸扬扬的外来者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "幸会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "这位是这间当铺的老板娘，单名一个“黎”字，黎明的黎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......你没有被奇怪的东西袭击吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "不曾见过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "黎姑娘，不知那些墨魉是不是还会回来，可否让我们躲藏在此处，观察一二？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "......嗯，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
